OL,3,GNEWSAAlloa mine shaft collapse
OL,4,A'completely unrelated' to Coalsnaughton
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mine shaft collapse in Alloa is
OL,7,F"completely unrelated" to ground
OL,8,Fmovement in a nearby village that has
OL,9,Fseen 97 families evacuated, according
OL,10,Fto a mining body.
OL,12,FThe exposed mine shaft was noticed on
OL,13,FMonday by businessman Derek Hanna, who
OL,14,Fsaid it was about a metre from a
OL,15,Fportable cabin at his car dealership on
OL,16,FClackmannan Road.
OL,18,FThe road was closed while the Mining
OL,19,FRemediation Authority (MRA) fenced off
OL,20,Fthe site and filled the shaft with
OL,21,Fstone to stabilise it.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
