OL,3,GNEWSAAlloa mine shaft collapse
OL,4,A'completely unrelated' to Coalsnaughton
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MRA said it had been an isolated
OL,7,Fincident and was not related to the
OL,8,Frecent evacuation in Coalsnaughton, a
OL,9,Fformer mining village which is about
OL,10,Ffour miles away.
